00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.967
<v Host>It means staying on in the same post.

00:03:35.568 --> 00:03:41.568
<v Slow>一方で、新しい顔ぶれも加わりました。

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:45.800
<v Host>On the other hand, new faces joined as well.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.776
