00:05:22.103 --> 00:05:24.696
<v Host>It means the ability to get things done.

00:05:25.295 --> 00:05:34.968
<v Slow>新しい内閣は、物価高対策や経済成長などの課題に取り組みます。

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:41.072
<v Host>The new cabinet will tackle challenges like high prices and economic growth.

00:05:41.672 --> 00:05:43.831
